<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;You may want to try adding the error checking from the [doc://do] docs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
unless (my $return = do $file) {
    warn "couldn't parse $file: $@" if $@;
    warn "couldn't do $file: $!"    unless defined $return;
    warn "couldn't run $file"       unless $return;
}
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;i&gt;Update:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/small&gt; Oh, and of course [id://111088].&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
